# The Three Kingdoms in Northern San d'Oria with the letter. The login plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in 878.
# Status 6: Kasaroro says KASARORO_DIALOG + 7 (no event); Heruze-Moruze answers his own 554. Status 11: Kasaroro shows
